      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "yes. I always wondered why it sometimes gives some search results. appears it mostly happened because the author name had that word in it.\n\nIt makes no sence to search for author name in the World search by default in my opinion. Of course it should be an option, but not the default. Or at least the weighting should be way less than it currently is, so worlds where searchword parts are included in the author name appear way later in the list.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
